# A Battle with no protector asks its controller to choose an opponent as
# soon as any state-based-action check runs -- CR 704.5w, assignBattleProtector
# -- and StartTurn's own Untap-step beginPhase is the first one, so no
# advance is needed to reach it. Defense is set directly in setup.state:
# nothing puts a Battle's printed starting defense on it yet (CR 704.5v's
# own ETB gap, game-state.md), so without it the Battle would die to zero
# defense before this scenario ever got to observe its protector.
queue battleprotector ai
startturn human
